<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Form Kapalı - Cumhuriyet Sitesi</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=16" />
  <style>
    body { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px; }
    .closed-container { max-width: 480px; width: 100%; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.1); padding: 40px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .closed-icon { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .closed-container h1 { margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 1.5rem; color: #1a3a5c; }
    .closed-container p { color: #6b7c93; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .closed-container .btn { display: inline-block; background: #1a3a5c; color: #fff; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="closed-container">
    <div class="closed-icon">🔒</div>
    <h1><%= form.baslik %></h1>
    <p>Bu form şu anda yanıt almaya kapalıdır. Daha sonra tekrar kontrol edebilirsiniz.</p>
    <a href="/" class="btn">Ana Sayfa</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
